{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2024-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1725753600, "end_date": 1726444799, "month_true_total": 24, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:24:31 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "175054943", "author": {"steamid": "76561198002559680", "personaname": "• rmelancia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/djrmelancia/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 198, "playtime_forever": 1667, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1667, "last_played": 1726429095, "avatar": "ed09c6672bd1159ba75b738bfb912ab4663cf324"}, "language": "english", "review": "Still really fun. Only now in 2024 did I unlock all the characters for the first time and there are so many cool ideas there... but yeah this game is hard and everything is time-sensitive. \r\nIf you have too much anxiety dealing with timebased challenges, maybe just play it on easy difficulty i guess.\r\n\r\nAlso try playing it with a controller.", "timestamp_created": 1726435717, "timestamp_updated": 1726435717, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.565217375755310059", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "175029322", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088730923", "personaname": "Ga(z)imon", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GaiGazimon/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 56, "playtime_forever": 2006, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2006, "last_played": 1549564786, "avatar": "c7ce89806691b1e8042fb661c9c40e3d288fc765"}, "language": "english", "review": ":D", "timestamp_created": 1726413282, "timestamp_updated": 1726413282, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.533678770065307617", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174952777", "author": {"steamid": "76561199145593420", "personaname": "johnnybgoodedoe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199145593420/", "num_games_owned": 320, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 1967, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1967, "last_played": 1726150307, "avatar": "c242d7da82e82215e4890e33ea3c4516d088899a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Directly from the indie golden years, the original got great replayability, not so steep learning curve (even with kinda stiff controls), special worldbuilding and athmosferic soundtrack; are we the baddies?. Solid 5/7, worth revisiting previous levels (+2 because it doesn't really rain).\r\n\r\nDirettamente dagli anni d'oro dell'indie, l'originale ha ottima rigiocabilità, curva d'apprendimento non troppo scoscesa (anche se controlli un po legnosi), worldbuilding speciale e colonna sonora atmosferica; siamo noi i cattivi? Un buon 5/7, vale la pena rivisitare un livello precedente (+2 perchè in realtà non piove).", "timestamp_created": 1726332528, "timestamp_updated": 1726332528, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174881138", "author": {"steamid": "76561198872340529", "personaname": "Jester", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ultrank/", "num_games_owned": 202, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 2907, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2878, "last_played": 1726252928, "avatar": "9b8adb62e7a67de6fabd454ec1c496bc0b295481"}, "language": "english", "review": "Peak.", "timestamp_created": 1726250723, "timestamp_updated": 1726250723, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "174767045", "author": {"steamid": "76561198047366069", "personaname": "Vadok", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/FinTuyokee/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 301, "playtime_forever": 2492, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 343, "last_played": 1743880887, "avatar": "18b9c3b6ddb83a115a23e47dfedad697d61f591c"}, "language": "english", "review": "While it might look like a very simple game due to the simple pixel art style, it's actually an addictive and fast paced brutal game.\r\n\r\nThe graphic style and music give a nostalgic feeling, and thanks to the roguelike elements you can replay it all over again.\r\n\r\nIt's not an easy gam,e though. It ramps up in difficulty brutally, forcing you to find the right balance between getting stronger and progressing through the game.\r\n\r\nBut the moment you win your first run? Nothing will feel as rewarding.\r\n\r\nGreat to play solo or with friends. It's really addicting.", "timestamp_created": 1726103701, "timestamp_updated": 1726103701, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}